---
const title = "Patricia E.";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import landscape from "../assets/landscape_trees_watercolor.png";
import treebirdsleft from "../assets/single_tree_birds_on_left.png";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="A little about me, my work, and the things I'm curious about." />
    <title>{title}</title>
    
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <header>
        <a class="name" href="/">Patricia E.</a>
        <nav>
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#work">What I Do</a>
          <a href="#ideas">Ideas</a>
          <a href="#worthsharing">Worth Sharing</a>
          <a href="#connect">Connect</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <section class="intro">
        <h1>Hello, and welcome!</h1>
        <p class="welcome">
            You might be here to learn more about me or to get in touch. I hope you can accomplish either or both if that's what you seek to do. 
        </p>
      </section>

      <Image
        src={treebirdsleft}
        alt=""
        class="site-image site-image--birds"
      />

      <section id="about">
        <h2>A little about me</h2>
        <p>I seem to have turned into this being who values a wide range of things, for example:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>neatly ordered lists</li>
        <li>nonviolence</li>
        <li>care for all beings and even non-living aspects of the world</li>
        <li>decreasing suffering for all</li>
        <li>communicating in ways that lead to peace</li>
        <li>ecology</li>
        <li>sustainability</li>
        <li>strategy</li>
        <li>conflict and how to mitigate conflict</li>
        <li>science / how stuff works</li>
        <li>some tech topics</li>
        <li>hiking, swimming, birding (new)</li>
        <li>meditation (Vipassana as of late)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Every once in a while I'll dabble in things like art (drawing by hand, making cards with various media, making rugs, making candles), technologies (making web pages, image creation using fancy apps, making videos), and learning random topics (e.g., straw bale house building, various languages but never long enough to be fluent)</p>
        <p>I guess I like to experience things at least enough to understand why others enjoy them. My curiosity is probably my greatest strength.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="work">
        <h2>What I do</h2>
        <p>I work full time as a Sr. Analyst in a corporate strategy department. I facilitate/train nonviolent communication.  I took on the social media manager position for a nonprofit at one point, creating images, messaging, and videos for them.</p>
        <p>I'd welcome interesting opportunities to learn, play, and do meaningful-to-me work.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="ideas">
        <h2>Ideas</h2>
        <p>Reflections, questions, and things I'm exploring:</p>
        <ul>
        <li>conflict resolution</li>
        <li>restorative circles</li>
        <li>anatta, how this creates suffering, and the potential to look differently</li>
        <li>whether the "mourning of needs not being met" (NVC) is simply the first noble truth (Buddhism) — not fighting the truth that there is suffering</li>
        <li>whether or not "getting empathy" helps me or reinforces my stories and suffering</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="worthsharing">
        <h2>Worth sharing</h2>
        <p>Books, people, articles, and other things worth sharing.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="connect">
        <h2>Connect</h2>
        <p>I'd be glad to hear from you.</p>
      </section>

      <Image
        src={landscape}
        alt=""
        class="site-image site-image--landscape"
      />

      <footer>
        All text, artwork, images, and site design on these pages are the sole property of Patricia Ewanski. Any use of these materials—including reproduction, modification, distribution, or republication—without their prior written permission is strictly prohibited.<br>
        <br>
        Copyright © Patricia Ewanski, 2026. All rights reserved.
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@100..900&family=Rock+Salt&display=swap');
:global(*) {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

:global(body) {
  margin: 0;
  background: #FFFFFC;
  color: #353A3D;
  font-family: 'Noto Sans', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

main {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 36px 28px 60px;
}

header {
  display: flex;
  width: 100vw;
  margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 24px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  padding: 0 28px 24px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #D8CFCF;
}

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

a:hover {
  color: #23B5D3;
}

.name {
  font-family: 'Rock Salt', cursive;
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: #350C0C;
}

nav {
  display: flex;
  gap: 18px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

nav a + a::before {
  content: "|";
  margin-right: 18px;
  color: #D8CFCF;
}

.intro {
  padding: 100px 0 10px;
  max-width: 650px;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: #836460;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  border-left: 3px solid #23B5D3;
  padding-left: 10px;
}

h1,
h2 {
  font-family: 'Noto Sans', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 400;
}

h1 {
  color: #350C0C;
  font-size: clamp(2.0rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
  line-height: 1.25;
  margin: 16px 0 24px;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
}

.welcome {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: #353A3D;
}

section:not(.intro) {
  padding: 38px 0;
  border-top: 1px solid #D8CFCF;
}

section:not(.intro) h2 {
  margin-top: 0;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

h2 {
  color: #353A3D;
  font-size: 1.8rem;
}

section:not(.intro) p,
section:not(.intro) li {
  color: #353A3D;
}

footer {
  width: 100vw;
  margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
  padding: 36px 28px 24px;
  color: #888a8a;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.site-image {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

.site-image--birds {
  max-width: 451px;
  margin: 10px 0 100px;
}

.site-image--landscape {
  width: 100vw;
  max-width: none;
  margin: 10px 0 40px;
  margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
  border-radius: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  main {
    padding: 24px 20px 45px;
  }

  header {
    padding-right: 20px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  footer {
    padding-right: 20px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .intro {
    padding: 70px 0 50px;
  }

  nav {
    gap: 12px;
  }

  nav a + a::before {
    margin-right: 12px;
  }
}
</style>